{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/47967-demonic-form-mirrored-skin-fast-attack-questions","id":47967,"title":"[Demonic Form] Mirrored Skin & Fast Attack Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-12T23:26:25-08:00","id":47967,"title":"[Demonic Form] Mirrored Skin & Fast Attack Questions","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> Got a few questions regarding some Demon form powers, hoping the collective hive mind (or one of the developers) might be able to shed some light on them for me and any others who happen to have the exact same questions.<br /> <br /> Mirrored Skin: Is Mirrored Skin instantly active the moment you turn into your Demonic state? I'm curious because I can't see an action in the text at all. From the flavour it seems like the demon is just cloaked all the time. Also, if you just move without making a stealth roll while Mirrored Skin is active, do enemies/observers need to make a contested perception roll to notice you, a standard perception roll or do they not need to roll at all?<br /> <br /> Fast Attack: The flavour text says &quot;Angels built for hand-to-hand combat are designed to be lightning fast. They can make strikes against an enemy in rapid succession before he gets a chance to respond. Demons with this ability have an advantage against multiple attackers.&quot; From the mechanical text my understanding is that a demon with this form ability should be able to attack the same opponent twice before they get an action?<br /> <br /> Example - 3 opponents (Enemy A, B &amp; C) vs the Demon. Enemy A has an initiative of 10, B has 13, C has 7 and the Demon has 12. After Enemy B has taken his turn at the top of the initiative order the Demon goes after him. The Demon chooses to attack Enemy A, the demon damages him but he is not out of the fight yet. Can the demon reset his initiative to go at 11 thus taking another action against Enemy A? Also, once Enemy A is out of the fight, can the Demon then choose another target for Fast Attack, or is it simply one and done for the fight? I'm also assuming as the flavour specifically mentions Angels built for hand-to-hand combat that it only works for brawl attacks and not weapon or firearms attacks.<br /> <br /> Cheers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T12:30:40-08:00","id":48399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheFrigidMidget</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/47967-demonic-form-mirrored-skin-fast-attack-questions#post47967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is Mirrored Skin instantly active the moment you turn into your Demonic state?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. The Demon is basically always cloaked while in Demonic Form (or while partially manifesting).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheFrigidMidget</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/47967-demonic-form-mirrored-skin-fast-attack-questions#post47967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, if you just move without making a stealth roll while Mirrored Skin is active, do enemies/observers need to make a contested perception roll to notice you, a standard perception roll or do they not need to roll at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm guessing observers just make a standard perception roll with the -1 penalty.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheFrigidMidget</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/47967-demonic-form-mirrored-skin-fast-attack-questions#post47967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fast Attack: [\u2026] From the mechanical text my understanding is that a demon with this form ability should be able to attack the same opponent twice before they get an action?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think so, no. My interpretation is that the Demon's initiative changes so they act before the target, but the Demon still acts no more than once per round. The Demon is allowed to change targets, however\u2014although they can't change initiative until after their first attack on the new target. I also see nothing in the system section that restricts the Fast Attack to melee attacks only, despite the flavor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1231,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","user":"gapb","date":".  Corrected a typo. 01-13-2014, 03:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","name":"gapb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T16:18:44-08:00","id":50212,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the reply gapb, it helps clear up my choices alot. I think the Fast Attack ability would need to be edited a bit in that case. Just so there's less overlap with the strike first embed, seeing as it does pretty much the same thing with a few other bits added on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T17:06:45-08:00","id":50250,"title":"","content":"I was thinking that a Mirroskinned demon would basically be moving stealthily all the time when they're in their demonic form. I'd just call for the contested roll with the bonus and penalty as long as the demon isn't attacking or otherwise behaving in an obvious manner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","name":"Smarmy Vamp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}